              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">ef034ca4-f974-4671-906a-4e7a803de58b</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Description</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Purpose: Annual mean radiant temperature at ground sensors, with interreflected sun and computed surface temperatures.
Fidelity: Engineering - Radiance shortwave plus EnergyPlus surface temperatures, not validated for this site.
Method: One MRT component runs Radiance (Standard quality) and EnergyPlus; Brep Grid Points meshes ground and context at 2 m.
Result: Annual mean MRT per probe, shown by Gradient and Text Tag.
Needs: Eddy3D Setup &gt; Comfort study (Radiance / EnergyPlus). Runtime: hours.
Edit: Ground and context Breps, the EPW URL; turn Run on.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="5">
